            <div><b>Cast spells</b><p>${Fs("Click a card in your hand, or drag a glowing card onto the table.","Tap a card in your hand, or drag a glowing card onto the table.")} ${Fs("Hold <b>Alt</b> or right-click to inspect.","Long-press to inspect, then release to close.")} You can only cast it if you have enough mana (the badge shows the cost).</p></div>
